            <ArticleTitle>[Surgical treatment of coronary heart disease in elderly patients].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>52-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Current approaches to the provision of effective medical aid to elderly patients with cardiovascular diseases are discussed. Clinical characteristics of such patients, concomitant pathologies, the strategy and extent of cardiosurgical treatment and postoperative therapy are described The original observations are compared with literature data concerning the immediate postoperative outcomes, clinical features, and peculiarities ofsurgical intervention in the patients of this age group.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
